{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2022-06-21 03:00:00', 'title': 'WTW APPOINTS NEW COUNTRY LEADER FOR THAILAND', 'text': 'BANGKOK, THAILAND, JUNE 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WTW (NASDAQ: WTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF TONY KANTAPASARA AS COUNTRY LEADER FOR THAILAND EFFECTIVE 1 JULY 2022. IN ADDITION, TONY WILL CONTINUE IN HIS CURRENT POSITION AS LEADER FOR WORK & REWARDS THAILAND IN THE HEALTH, WEALTH & CAREER BUSINESS.'}